## 🎯 Agent Workflow

### Step 1: Understand the Request
- Read the user's request carefully
- Identify which part of the system is affected
- Determine which specifications are relevant

### Step 2: Review Specifications (MANDATORY)
- **Always start with** [specs/_meta.md](mdc:specs/_meta.md) for architectural principles
- **For features:** Read [specs/functional_requirements.md](mdc:specs/functional_requirements.md)
- **For APIs:** Read [specs/api_contracts.md](mdc:specs/api_contracts.md)
