## 🎨 Theme System

The application uses a **global theme configuration system**. All components must:
- Use theme values instead of hardcoded colors/sizes
- Access theme through theme provider/context
- Support the centralized theme configuration
- Follow the theme structure defined in [specs/_meta.md](mdc:specs/_meta.md) section 5

---

## 🔒 Security Requirements

### Authentication
- JWT-based with short-lived access tokens (15 min) and refresh tokens (7 days)
- Support phone, email, and Telegram authentication
- OTP-based authentication flow

### Authorization
- Role-Based Access Control (RBAC): customer, sales, admin
- Server-side enforcement on every request
- Resource ownership checks (customers can only access their own resources)

### Data Protection
- Input validation using Pydantic models (backend) and form validation (frontend)
- ORM parameterized queries only (no raw SQL)
- XSS prevention with input sanitization
- File upload security with type and size validation

---

## 📝 Code Quality Standards

### Type Safety
- **Frontend:** TypeScript with proper types
- **Backend:** Python type hints

### Error Handling
- Standardized error response format across all APIs
- User-friendly error messages
- Proper HTTP status codes
- Business rule validation on server-side

### Testing
- Write unit tests for business logic
- Integration tests for API endpoints
- Consider edge cases and error scenarios

